==About==
'''RLCS Season 7 ''' is the first [[RLCS]] season in 2019. This season marks the start of a partnership between Psyonix and [https://www.eleague.com/ ELEAGUE] featuring 'wide-ranging' content including a multi-part feature series on the [[RLCS]] on TBS Television.<ref name="eleague partnership">{{cite web|url=https://www.eleague.com/rocketleague-2019/news/partnership|title=ELEAGUE and Psyonix Announce Wide-Ranging Content, Business and Event Partnership|date=2019-02-11|author=[[ELEAGUE]]}}</ref>
[[Rocket League Championship Series/Season 7|Season 7]] of the [[Rocket League Championship Series]] also introduces a 4th region to the division - [[Rocket League Championship Series/Season 7/South America|South America]].<ref name="South America">{{cite web|url=https://www.rocketleagueesports.com/news/introducing-rlcs-season-7/|title=INTRODUCING RLCS SEASON 7|date=2019-01-29|author=[[RLCS]]}}</ref>

The World Championship finals took place in Newark, United States at the [https://www.prucenter.com/ Prudential Center].

