===Format===
*'''Group Stage''' - ''June 21st-22nd''
**12 teams split into 4 groups of 3.
**Round Robin {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
***Tiebreakers:
****In the case of a tie on points game differential always seeds the teams
**The <span class="bg-up">Top 2</span> from each group - 8 in total - advances to the [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
*'''Playoffs''' - ''June 23rd''
**Single Elimination Bracket.
***Quarter-Finals are {{Abbr/Bo5}} with the Semi-Finals and Finals as a {{Abbr/Bo7}}.

